  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe Debug Log has Expand, Scroll, Log, Warning, Error and Background at the top of it. Since 1780 these appear to be scrolling up / down with the log it self instead of always being on top of the Debug Log.\n\nThis makes it incredibility annoying to change to change these options.\n\n# Expected Behaviour\n\nThe Expand, Scroll, Log, Warning, Error and Background buttons should always be on top / above the log scroll view to make them easier to access. This is also how it worked on the prior build.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing it scrolling with the log:",
